</node>
<node id="Battle of Mollwitz">
  <data key="d0">Battle of Mollwitz</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Battle of Mollwitz is cited as a specific engagement where Prussian shooting skills reached their peak level.&lt;SEP&gt;The Battle of Mollwitz occurred on April 10, 1741, resulting in a Prussian victory during the First Silesian War.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ea6ac7b39b9305030f2c7226a86db43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e</data>
