</node>
<node id="Seven Years' War">
  <data key="d0">Seven Years' War</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">During this war, Prussian cavalry numbers increased despite a reduction in infantry numbers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Seven Years' War was a conflict during which East Prussia and Westphalia were occupied by foreign powers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Seven Years' War saw East Prussia and Westphalia occupied by foreign forces temporarily.&lt;SEP&gt;The Seven Years' War is another name for the Third Silesian War.&lt;SEP&gt;A global conflict occurring in the mid-18th century which included the Battle of Prague.&lt;SEP&gt;A historical conflict during which the Prussian Army achieved notable marching speeds, serving as a benchmark for comparison.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ea6ac7b39b9305030f2c7226a86db43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f00c9046ba6740391ca82c677577b2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66ab621011ad683c952d4d1bfeab457d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-223fc84be8831740cffa7582ec0ee05a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8178aa22ecf62d882629768387c8db</data>
