<node id="Firearms">
  <data key="d0">Firearms</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Firearms refer to the weapons whose improvement significantly enhanced the importance of infantry troops.&lt;SEP&gt;Firearms represent advanced weaponry whose training significantly improved infantry importance and helped maintain their numerical advantage.&lt;SEP&gt;Firearms were improved weapons that significantly increased the quantity of infantry available for combat.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-0ea6ac7b39b9305030f2c7226a86db43&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3c6b62745fd7ff550d76846c1a46a8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-223fc84be8831740cffa7582ec0ee05a</data>
