<node id="French Army">
  <data key="d0">French Army</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The French Army is a military organization noted for its historical prominence, often described as having an unparalleled status, though it has also endured significant defeats. Its service record spans from the Seven Years' War, during which it occupied Westphalia, through the War of the Grand Alliance and the Silesian Wars, where it numbered 45,000 men at Fleurus. During the Revolutionary Wars and subsequent Napoleonic era, under the command of Napoleon, Davout, and Murat, the force was active in various theaters. Napoleon led campaigns in 1797 and 1806 against Prussian forces, where the French Army's movements influenced the Prussian Army's decision-making process regarding assembly. Additionally, forces operated in Spain under Napoleon, contributing to conflicts in European and neighboring regions.

Logistically, the French Army relied heavily on local provisions and utilized on-site requisitioning as its basic supply system since the French Revolutionary Wars. This strategy often depleted local resources, particularly evident during operations in Spain. In the 1812 Russian Campaign, the French Army acted as an attacking force pressuring the Russian Army in enemy territory. However, they faced severe issues with weather and quartering. Key events included the retreat from Moscow and the Battle of Tarutino, resulting in losses of men and artillery. Following significant defeats, the army retreated across various rivers during the 1812-1813 campaigns. Finally, in 1815, the force was pursued by Blücher, marking the conclusion of this era of conflict for the unit.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f1e8fe38b90ff6dffdb7380ea9e159d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7172c419264d7047e81ab4a26a236796&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-942da2473ae7c7645f080c44aba00371&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22b58faf893c88031c709a0cfac971fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bace62a86e707c9881144ea59dde7a4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc6725d3545cdb40e1dfdd2209aba40f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c6e328b37fa2162a0fbd3f638331548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66ab621011ad683c952d4d1bfeab457d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d696492803499031b7e887c1814ba23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9de7adb6e29e9aaaa3a95674b64a2552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-223fc84be8831740cffa7582ec0ee05a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffd9ee2ca6a2dbeb008f986d03860045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adfddc40b68714749a17f1f73f04abea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77045b1c2599a8ac0acb0e781562ae49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-516f6a00a475faea10c611a860305297&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5caa7084b9aab1683b075dc4fc333250</data>
