<node id="War of Austrian Succession">
  <data key="d0">War of Austrian Succession</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">This event serves as a historical marker after which cavalry-to-infantry ratios remained relatively constant.&lt;SEP&gt;The War of Austrian Succession took place from 1740 to 1748 and included the First and Second Silesian Wars.</data>
