<node id="Side Vanguard">
  <data key="d0">Side Vanguard</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Side Vanguard refers to the troops deployed on the flanks which function as forward units to delay enemy movement and provide time for countermeasures.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e42e0d19c01d89b60bcea1e8c8214463</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\战争论.pdf</data>
