<node id="Flanders">
  <data key="d0">Flanders</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Flanders is a location where historical wars were fought involving commanders like Francois Luxembourg.&lt;SEP&gt;Flanders is a region in Western Europe currently divided between Belgium, France, and the Netherlands, historically significant for its wars.&lt;SEP&gt;Flanders is a region characterized by high population density, making it easier to supply military forces compared to other areas.&lt;SEP&gt;Flanders is a specific geographical region known for its common cultivated landscapes suitable for military reference.&lt;SEP&gt;Flanders is a region associated with deep ploughed land that significantly impacts the complexity of warfare.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c6ca1393bac88b8acf9da2a729f68294&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb948420cdd6d2bd78179f476f0df5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5a2918db8fd4527a62709762ff6d5e2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bace62a86e707c9881144ea59dde7a4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fc6725d3545cdb40e1dfdd2209aba40f</data>
