  <data key="d2">Holstein is another regional area noted for cultivated land characteristics impacting warfare.&lt;SEP&gt;Holstein is a region noted for common deep ploughed land similar to Flanders, influencing operational tactics.&lt;SEP&gt;Holstein was a historical duchy in northern Germany, referenced in footnotes regarding historical context.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c6ca1393bac88b8acf9da2a729f68294&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adb948420cdd6d2bd78179f476f0df5a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-407ccaa628a42045b9ed85ea7bc4db1d</data>
