<node id="1812 Campaign">
  <data key="d0">1812 Campaign</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The 1812 Campaign involved the French invasion of Russia and subsequent retreat through harsh conditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The 1812 Campaign is referenced to illustrate that attackers and defenders often operate within the same space with potentially identical intentions.&lt;SEP&gt;The 1812 Campaign involved a French military failure where Murat commanded the rear guard retreat.&lt;SEP&gt;A major military conflict involving the Russian Empire against French forces, divided into phases of advance and retreat.&lt;SEP&gt;The 1812 Campaign is a specific historical war scenario cited to illustrate the practical application of base and retreat strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;A military conflict in 1812 involving Russian and French armies where the Russian army retreated across vast territories.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-942da2473ae7c7645f080c44aba00371&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3c6b62745fd7ff550d76846c1a46a8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c6e328b37fa2162a0fbd3f638331548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9b9839be4f5c76a97ace71baf8a2625&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77045b1c2599a8ac0acb0e781562ae49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-516f6a00a475faea10c611a860305297&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9577d681c513d8a72e8f9e09ad316f8c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5caa7084b9aab1683b075dc4fc333250</data>
