<node id="Neman River">
  <data key="d0">Neman River</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The Neman River is another name for the Memel River, located in Belarus and Lithuania.&lt;SEP&gt;The Neman River was reached by French forces in late December 1812 during their retreat.&lt;SEP&gt;The boundary river crossed by Napoleon on June 24, 1812, marking the start of the Russian campaign.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-942da2473ae7c7645f080c44aba00371&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72c55a94307c751d0e9fbf6270e7773d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5caa7084b9aab1683b075dc4fc333250</data>
