  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Organ bodies responsible for transporting grain to troops in rest from distant sources.&lt;SEP&gt;Quartermaster Department manages collected supplies, ensuring they are distributed only to units that lack their own provisions.</data>
