<node id="Mountainous Terrain">
  <data key="d0">Mountainous Terrain</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A specific geographic environment characterized by slow marching speeds and safer defensive positions.&lt;SEP&gt;A geographical condition requiring a division of 8000 soldiers to take 10–12 hours for a daily march.&lt;SEP&gt;Mountainous Terrain provides protection from fire for heavy artillery and poses difficulties for movement but allows infantry superiority.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f5bb89666881fe685b53314cebe1abaa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-407ccaa628a42045b9ed85ea7bc4db1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8178aa22ecf62d882629768387c8db</data>
