<node id="Provincial Government">
  <data key="d0">Provincial Government</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The local administrative body responsible for distributing pay and supplies to the Landwehr units in Prussia.&lt;SEP&gt;Provincial Governments provided funding and supplies for the Reserve Army.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b7f6e47322107075587da5b8dd1c7e</data>
