<node id="Short Axe">
  <data key="d0">Short Axe</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A melee weapon equipped to Landwehr soldiers as part of their basic gear alongside pikes when gun supplies were low.&lt;SEP&gt;Short Axes were issued alongside spears to Reserve Army members lacking firearms.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b7f6e47322107075587da5b8dd1c7e</data>
