<node id="Holy Roman Empire">
  <data key="d0">Holy Roman Empire</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Holy Roman Empire existed from 962 to 1806 and had emperors who launched expeditions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Holy Roman Empire contributed forces to the coalition defeated by François de Luxembourg at the Battle of Fleurus.&lt;SEP&gt;The Holy Roman Empire was a major political entity in Central Europe whose authority was weakened by the Peace of Westphalia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bace62a86e707c9881144ea59dde7a4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b03fbc1bc0a2f36813dfff78edd095</data>
