<node id="First Silesian War">
  <data key="d0">First Silesian War</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The First Silesian War began in 1740 with Frederick II attacking Silesia.&lt;SEP&gt;The First Silesian War occurred between 1740 and 1742 as part of the War of Austrian Succession.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f00c9046ba6740391ca82c677577b2f</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\战争论.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778774783</data>
