<node id="Frederick II">
  <data key="d0">Frederick II</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Frederick II commanded Prussian forces in the First Silesian War and the Battle of Mollwitz.&lt;SEP&gt;Frederick II was the King of Prussia who fought in the Silesian Wars against alliances including Austria, France, Russia, and Sweden.&lt;SEP&gt;Frederick II is the King of Prussia who participated in the Silesian Wars and the Seven Years' War.&lt;SEP&gt;Frederick II was the Prussian monarch who led troops from Silesia into Moravia and besieged Olmütz.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f00c9046ba6740391ca82c677577b2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e5cd33cb23eede2329c705a877b7cf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bace62a86e707c9881144ea59dde7a4a</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\战争论.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778774783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Neipperg">
  <data key="d0">Neipperg</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Neipperg led Austrian forces threatening the Prussian rear in 1741.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\战争论.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778774783</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Austrian Army">
  <data key="d0">Austrian Army</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Austrian Army advanced towards the Prussian rear under Neipperg during the Silesian War.&lt;SEP&gt;The Austrian Army utilized a powerful outpost system and frequently dispatched vanguard units forward compared to Frederick's methods.&lt;SEP&gt;The Austrian Army was the opposing force whose left wing was attacked by Frederick The Great during the battle.&lt;SEP&gt;The Austrian Army supported Russian objectives, moving from Silesia and engaging near Olmütz.&lt;SEP&gt;The opposing military force encountered by Prussian troops during maneuvers prior to the Battle of Prague.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e5cd33cb23eede2329c705a877b7cf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68bce0e3733aefaac111940411ed6dd7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38f13e59336c7bb333fab6bbbe0ac097&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8178aa22ecf62d882629768387c8db</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\战争论.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778774784</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
