<node id="East Prussia">
  <data key="d0">East Prussia</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">East Prussia is a region located far from the home territory, covering part of the national area.&lt;SEP&gt;East Prussia was a distant province of Prussia occupied during the Seven Years' War.&lt;SEP&gt;East Prussia is the location where Scharnhorst applied the outpost line method to the Prussian army in 1807.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-223fc84be8831740cffa7582ec0ee05a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ceef5e0b237a9edd2580a6c4fbfed04</data>
