<node id="Baltic Sea">
  <data key="d0">Baltic Sea</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">East Prussia was located along the southeast coast of the Baltic Sea.&lt;SEP&gt;The Baltic Sea receives the waters of the Vistula River after its origin in the Carpathian Mountains.&lt;SEP&gt;The Baltic Sea contains important ports acquired by Sweden following the Peace of Westphalia.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88b03fbc1bc0a2f36813dfff78edd095&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9de7adb6e29e9aaaa3a95674b64a2552</data>
