<node id="Britain">
  <data key="d0">Britain</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Britain allied with Prussia and Hanover during the Silesian Wars and commanded coalition forces at the Battle of Steinkerque.&lt;SEP&gt;Britain was an ally of Prussia and Hanover in the Silesian Wars.&lt;SEP&gt;Britain was an enemy nation that declared war against France in 1793 and fought alongside Holland.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2f00c9046ba6740391ca82c677577b2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bace62a86e707c9881144ea59dde7a4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9b9839be4f5c76a97ace71baf8a2625</data>
