<node id="Modern Warfare">
  <data key="d0">Modern Warfare</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">A mode of warfare where the principle of firepower destruction plays a major role alongside single combat.&lt;SEP&gt;Modern warfare is characterized by large army scales and continuous operational states.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ff1b2820cc1e95701eebf7342c4385d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfca00a9897a7d585d9175d5bc52771c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5caa7084b9aab1683b075dc4fc333250</data>
