<node id="Battle of Fleurus">
  <data key="d0">Battle of Fleurus</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Battle of Fleurus is one of the engagements commanded by Francois Luxembourg conducted under a different concept.&lt;SEP&gt;On July 1, 1690, François de Luxembourg defeated a coalition army near Fleurus through flanking maneuvers and heavy cavalry pursuit.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5a2918db8fd4527a62709762ff6d5e2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bace62a86e707c9881144ea59dde7a4a</data>
