<node id="Battle of Neerwinden">
  <data key="d0">Battle of Neerwinden</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Battle of Neerwinden is another significant battle led by Francois Luxembourg challenging previous warfare norms.&lt;SEP&gt;On July 29, 1693, François de Luxembourg defeated William III again at Neerwinden securing a decisive victory.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5a2918db8fd4527a62709762ff6d5e2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bace62a86e707c9881144ea59dde7a4a</data>
