  <data key="d0">气象、季节和地形因素</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">气象、季节和地形因素are natural conditions that are disregarded during rapid troop movements.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-4c75ae5a30f00349c000ec1fc88a99c2</data>
