<node id="Coalition Forces">
  <data key="d0">Coalition Forces</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Coalition Forces represented allied armies opposing Napoleon, featuring varying infantry and cavalry strengths.&lt;SEP&gt;Allied forces opposing the French Army that had to adopt similar supply methods due to effectiveness.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-22b58faf893c88031c709a0cfac971fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41b7f6e47322107075587da5b8dd1c7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-942da2473ae7c7645f080c44aba00371</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\战争论.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778774802</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="French Revolutionary Wars">
  <data key="d0">French Revolutionary Wars</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The era during which Vendéan troops were active and designated as corps.&lt;SEP&gt;Historical conflict period starting the era of the French Army's specific supply system.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-22b58faf893c88031c709a0cfac971fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9577d681c513d8a72e8f9e09ad316f8c</data>
