  <data key="d0">Army Size</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">The number of troops determined by the available financial resources to sustain supply, inversely related to expensive supply systems.&lt;SEP&gt;A factor determining the scale of dependency on supply bases, with larger armies requiring more stable infrastructure.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-22b58faf893c88031c709a0cfac971fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-516f6a00a475faea10c611a860305297</data>
