<node id="Grand Alliance War">
  <data key="d0">Grand Alliance War</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Grand Alliance War (1688–1697) featured new tactical trends and intense fighting, marking Louis XIV's third foreign war.</data>
