</node>
<node id="Imperial Coalition">
  <data key="d0">Imperial Coalition</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Imperial Coalition included the Holy Roman Empire, Spain, and Sweden forces opposing the French Army.</data>
