  <data key="d0">Leipzig</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">The city near which the York Corps arrived on October 19, 1813, having lost most of its initial strength.&lt;SEP&gt;A major German city in Saxony located at the confluence of the Elster, Plisse, and Parthe rivers.&lt;SEP&gt;Leipzig is the capital city of Saxony containing the Möckern district.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-72c55a94307c751d0e9fbf6270e7773d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c6e328b37fa2162a0fbd3f638331548&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfca00a9897a7d585d9175d5bc52771c</data>
