  <data key="d0">Löwenberg</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Site of a major battle for the York Corps during the 1813 campaign.&lt;SEP&gt;The historical name for the Polish town formerly known as Lwówek.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-72c55a94307c751d0e9fbf6270e7773d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c6e328b37fa2162a0fbd3f638331548</data>
