<node id="Russian Campaign">
  <data key="d0">Russian Campaign</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Russian Campaign is a military event where supply failures contributed heavily to the defeat of the invading force.&lt;SEP&gt;The Russian Campaign was a military operation where logistical failure regarding supplies played a major role in the outcome.</data>
