<node id="Zieten">
  <data key="d0">Zieten</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Zieten is a Prussian Marshal known for participating in the Battle of Ligny and the Battle of Waterloo.&lt;SEP&gt;Zieten leads the vanguard of the Prussian army and is defeated by Napoleon.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8b814c286eb1e073648265d5177eb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffd9ee2ca6a2dbeb008f986d03860045</data>
