<node id="Friedrich II">
  <data key="d0">Friedrich II</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Friedrich II was a Prussian king who suffered a rare defeat at Hochkirch during the Silesian War after misjudging enemy movements.&lt;SEP&gt;Friedrich II is associated with the mid-18th century military era where movement became a distinct element of combat.&lt;SEP&gt;The primary commander of the Prussian forces who led major strategies during the Seven Years' War.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8b814c286eb1e073648265d5177eb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ceef5e0b237a9edd2580a6c4fbfed04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8178aa22ecf62d882629768387c8db</data>
