<node id="Sombreffe">
  <data key="d0">Sombreffe</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Sombreffe is a location in Namur Province that includes the former city of Ligny.&lt;SEP&gt;Sombreffe is a destination for Vandamme and part of Blücher's deployment line.&lt;SEP&gt;Sombreffe is the central assembly point where parts of the Prussian Army gathered despite distance constraints.&lt;SEP&gt;Sombreffe is a city in Namur Province, Belgium.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8b814c286eb1e073648265d5177eb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffd9ee2ca6a2dbeb008f986d03860045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adfddc40b68714749a17f1f73f04abea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfca00a9897a7d585d9175d5bc52771c</data>
