  <data key="d0">Winter Camp</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Winter Camp refers to the established practice of troops entering winter quarters for rest before campaigning seasons.&lt;SEP&gt;Winter Camp is a logistical method where armies established seasonal quarters during winter for stability and rest.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a8b814c286eb1e073648265d5177eb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfca00a9897a7d585d9175d5bc52771c</data>
