<node id="Scharnhorst">
  <data key="d0">Scharnhorst</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Scharnhorst was a designer of military organizations who drafted the Landwehr Organizational Law.&lt;SEP&gt;Scharnhorst served in the Anglo-Dutch Coalition army and introduced the outpost line method to the Prussian army in East Prussia.&lt;SEP&gt;Scharnhorst served in the Hanoverian Army, later joined the Anglo-Dutch Alliance, and eventually Prussian Army, supporting Russians at the Battle of Eylau.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41b7f6e47322107075587da5b8dd1c7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9b9839be4f5c76a97ace71baf8a2625&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ceef5e0b237a9edd2580a6c4fbfed04</data>
