<node id="Cannons">
  <data key="d0">Cannons</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Cannons were military weapons whose quantity increased as weight decreased and construction improved.&lt;SEP&gt;Cannons were lost by the French Army during the Battle of Tarutino and represent military equipment used in combat.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-41b7f6e47322107075587da5b8dd1c7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffd9ee2ca6a2dbeb008f986d03860045</data>
