  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Cologne is a city located on the banks of the Rhine River in North Rhine-Westphalia, Germany.&lt;SEP&gt;Cologne serves as a starting point of a supply route where provisions are obtained easily through commerce.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a2a90ee6c570c1f41213848bde0e55e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9de7adb6e29e9aaaa3a95674b64a2552</data>
