<node id="Paris">
  <data key="d0">Paris</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Paris is the capital of France, referenced in the context of nearby Troyes.&lt;SEP&gt;Paris serves as an endpoint of a supply route where provisions are obtained through commercial contracts and drafts.</data>
