<node id="Liège">
  <data key="d0">Liège</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Liège is the direction toward which part of the Prussian Army's camping area extended.&lt;SEP&gt;Liège is the capital of Liège Province, located west of Sombreffe.&lt;SEP&gt;Liège is an intermediate city on the supply route connecting Cologne to Paris with reliable provision access.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a2a90ee6c570c1f41213848bde0e55e5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adfddc40b68714749a17f1f73f04abea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfca00a9897a7d585d9175d5bc52771c</data>
