<node id="Peace Of Westphalia">
  <data key="d0">Peace Of Westphalia</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Peace of Westphalia was a series of treaties signed in 1648 that ended the Thirty Years' War and shaped European international law.</data>
