</node>
<node id="Fiefdom System">
  <data key="d0">Fiefdom System</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Fiefdom System was a medieval land tenure arrangement in Western Europe based on obligations between lords and vassals.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-88b03fbc1bc0a2f36813dfff78edd095</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\战争论.pdf</data>
