<node id="Carpathian Mountains">
  <data key="d0">Carpathian Mountains</data>
  <data key="d1">naturalobject</data>
  <data key="d2">The Carpathian Mountains serve as the origin point for the Vistula River, Poland's longest river.&lt;SEP&gt;The Carpathian Mountains are a mountain range in Central Europe that serves as the source of the Vistula River.</data>
