<node id="Belgium">
  <data key="d0">Belgium</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Belgium was the deployment area for the Southern Army of the Coalition before the Battle of Waterloo.&lt;SEP&gt;Belgium is a country containing cities such as Charleroi and Namur Province where historical battles occurred.&lt;SEP&gt;Belgium is the modern nation containing the cities of Sombreffe, Ciney, and Liège referenced in the footnotes.&lt;SEP&gt;Belgium is the modern nation where the city of Namur serves as the capital of its province.&lt;SEP&gt;Belgium is a European country containing capitals like Brussels and Mons along with the Scheldt River.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-88b03fbc1bc0a2f36813dfff78edd095&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9de7adb6e29e9aaaa3a95674b64a2552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffd9ee2ca6a2dbeb008f986d03860045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfca00a9897a7d585d9175d5bc52771c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5caa7084b9aab1683b075dc4fc333250</data>
