  <data key="d0">Geometric Shape Principle</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Geometric Shape Principle dictates ideal configurations for encampments but is secondary to terrain considerations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-15f89854b5dda629cc5dcfc4edcef1c4</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\战争论.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778774817</data>
