</node>
<node id="Frederick The Great">
  <data key="d0">Frederick The Great</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Frederick The Great is a historical figure referenced regarding the requirements for organizing marches in the Seven Years' War.&lt;SEP&gt;Frederick The Great entered the Battle Of Leuthen battlefield and commanded the army, targeting the Austrian left wing.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-38f13e59336c7bb333fab6bbbe0ac097&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70a0950d107000f63848660e8ffc0706</data>
