  <data key="d0">Prague</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Prague is a location referenced where a similar four-way dance march maneuver was previously performed.&lt;SEP&gt;A city located in Bohemia where the division occurred near the rivers Elbe and Izera.</data>
