  <data key="d0">Hungary</data>
  <data key="d1">location</data>
  <data key="d2">Hungary is cited as a region maintaining recruitment duties as taxes similarly to Russia.&lt;SEP&gt;Hungary is a region mentioned as practicing a government-funded military supply system alongside Russia.&lt;SEP&gt;Hungary is a country through which the Danube River flows towards the Black Sea.</data>
