  <data key="d0">Silesian War</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">The Silesian War was a conflict where Friedrich II experienced a rare defeat against Marshall Dohna at Hochkirch.&lt;SEP&gt;The Silesian War is a historical period during which the use of direct foraging methods for army needs was reduced.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1ceef5e0b237a9edd2580a6c4fbfed04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c8520f94840f0c06aabc2e77297761e</data>
