  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Army">
  <data key="d0">Army</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Army has become an instrument of the government, facing threats from enemies and reliant on specific supply mechanisms.&lt;SEP&gt;The Army is the military force dependent on bases for provisions and supplies to maintain its operational freedom.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-77045b1c2599a8ac0acb0e781562ae49&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c8520f94840f0c06aabc2e77297761e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9de7adb6e29e9aaaa3a95674b64a2552</data>
