<node id="Government">
  <data key="d0">Government</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Government is the administrative body that acts as a tool for the army and is responsible for its costs through tax revenue.&lt;SEP&gt;Government bodies are described as the central authority controlling army funding and recruitment policies.</data>
