<node id="Prussian Army">
  <data key="d0">Prussian Army</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Prussian Army represents a historical military force characterized by varying command structures and operational tactics. Under the leadership of Frederick II, the Prussian Army achieved victory at the Battle of Mollwitz, although this period also involved experiencing damage from marching and supply constraints. Historical analysis of this era frequently discusses marching procedures and organizational units within the force. Additionally, the Prussian Army implemented critical logistical changes, such as reducing baggage trains and adopting foraging methods, which significantly affected its overall mobility.

In the early 19th century, the Prussian Army suffered a notable defeat by Napoleon's forces during the 1806 campaign, specifically including the Battle of Jena and Auerstädt. During this time, Scharnhorst transferred to the Prussian Army in 1801 and became a Chief of Staff in 1807. Records regarding leadership during the Napoleonic conflicts contain discrepancies; some sources associate the army with Marshal Zieten and his service record including major battles, whereas other descriptions state it was led by Zieten, Blücher, and Vandamme engaging with Napoleon's forces. In contrast, further accounts affirm that the Prussian Army was led by Blücher and collaborated with the British forces to defeat Napoleon. Ultimately, the force participated in the 1815 campaign but faced challenges regarding safe camping and assembly. These collective records define the Prussian Army through its evolving organization, logistical innovations, and complex leadership history across multiple campaigns.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-9ed0edc361ac37e0deef9374d8ec557e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e5cd33cb23eede2329c705a877b7cf6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a8b814c286eb1e073648265d5177eb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-66ab621011ad683c952d4d1bfeab457d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9b9839be4f5c76a97ace71baf8a2625&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9de7adb6e29e9aaaa3a95674b64a2552&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ffd9ee2ca6a2dbeb008f986d03860045&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-adfddc40b68714749a17f1f73f04abea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb8178aa22ecf62d882629768387c8db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5caa7084b9aab1683b075dc4fc333250&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-942da2473ae7c7645f080c44aba00371</data>
  <data key="d4">D:\Academic resources\战争论.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1778774836</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
